{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17648","headline":"巴南郡斋雨中偶看长历是日小雪有怀昔年朝谒因成八韵 · 羊士谔","name":"巴南郡斋雨中偶看长历是日小雪有怀昔年朝谒因成八韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夷落朝云候，王正小雪辰。\n缅怀朝紫陌，曾是洒朱轮。\n气耿簪裾肃，风严刻漏频。\n暗飞金马仗，寒舞玉京尘。\n豸角随中宪，龙池列近臣。\n蘂珠凝瑞彩，悬圃净华茵。\n帝泽千箱庆，天颜万物春。\n明廷犹咫尺，高咏愧巴人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17648.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17648","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}